ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_LeaderBlue2Intro::
	.string "BLUE: Yo! Finally got here, huh?\p"
	.string "I wasn’t in the mood as CINNABAR,\n"
	.string "but now I’m ready to battle you.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "You’re telling me you conquered all\n"
	.string "the GYMS in JOHTO?\p"
	.string "Heh! JOHTO’s GYMS must be pretty\n"
	.string "pathetic then.\p"
	.string "Hey, don’t worry about it.\p"
	.string "I’ll know if you are good or not\n"
	.string "by battling you right now.\p"
	.string "Ready, JOHTO CHAMP?$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_LeaderBlue2Defeat::
	.string "BLUE: What?\n"
	.string "How the heck did I lose to you?\p"
	.string "..\p"
	.string "Tch, all right... here, take this--\n"
	.string "it’s EARTHBADGE.\p"
	.string "{FONT 0x02}{PLAYER} received the EARTHBADGE!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_LeaderBlue2_1::
	.string "BLUE: Listen, you.\n"
	.string "You’d better not lose until I beat\l"
	.string "you. Got it?$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_LeaderBlue2_2::
	.string "BLUE: ...\p"
	.string "All right. I was wrong.\n"
	.string "You’re the real deal.\p"
	.string "You are a good trainer.\p"
	.string "But I’m going to beat you someday.\n"
	.string "Don’t you forget it!$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_GymGuy_1::
	.string "Yo, CHAMP in making!\n"
	.string "How’s it going?\p"
	.string "Looks like you’re on a roll.\p"
	.string "The GYM LEADER is a guy who battled\n"
	.string "the CHAMPION three years ago.\p"
	.string "He’s no pushover.\p"
	.string "Give it everything you’ve got!$"

ViridianCity_Interior2_Text_GymGuy_2::
	.string "Man, you are truly tough...\p"
	.string "That was a heck of an inspirational\n"
	.string "battle.\p"
	.string "It brought tears to my eyes.$"

